1
00:00:00,177 --> 00:00:03,107
(Amy:)Make a baby?
What are you talking about?

2
00:00:03,113 --> 00:00:06,613
(Sheldon:)Clearly the combination
of our DNA is exceptional.

3
00:00:06,617 --> 00:00:08,987
Eh... Our child could be
the next step

4
00:00:08,986 --> 00:00:10,686
(Sheldon:)in the evolution of mankind.

5
00:00:10,688 --> 00:00:13,618
We... we'll be able to get
into any preschool we want!

6
00:00:13,624 --> 00:00:16,324
Sh-Sheldon, I'm not ready
to have a baby.

7
00:00:16,327 --> 00:00:18,857
Oh, yes, you are!
I track your cycle.

8
00:00:19,997 --> 00:00:22,197
(Sheldon:)For the next 36 hours
you're as fertile

9
00:00:22,199 --> 00:00:25,269
(Sheldon:)as a manure-covered wheat field.

10
00:00:26,437 --> 00:00:28,767
Wow. I-I can actually feel

11
00:00:28,772 --> 00:00:31,742
(Amy:)the egg crawling its way
back up.

12
00:00:33,377 --> 00:00:34,877
(Sheldon:)I don't understand.

13
00:00:34,879 --> 00:00:37,349
(Sheldon:)I thought you'd be thrilled
to procreate with me.

14
00:00:37,348 --> 00:00:39,048
(Amy:)Not right now.
Oh,

15
00:00:39,049 --> 00:00:40,819
(Sheldon:)I see what's happening here.

16
00:00:40,818 --> 00:00:43,948
(Sheldon:)You're playing hard to get.

17
00:00:43,954 --> 00:00:46,284
(Amy:)I'm not playing anything.

18
00:00:46,290 --> 00:00:48,290
(Amy:)We're not making a baby today.

